 6, hard limit: 12\n- Total shortfall: 6\n- Uncovered interest: `evaluation:interest:typescript` — \"TypeScript 类型系统与编译器演进\" (TypeScript type system and compiler evolution)\n\nThere are no pending admission candidates, so I need to plan searches. The only source is `open_web` with `relevance` mode supported.\n\nInterest: TypeScript 类型系统与编译器演进 (TypeScript type system and compiler evolution). Active, no preference directions yet, no negative constraints.\n\nBudget: 12 searches, 40 reads, 200 raw results.\n\nI need to find candidates for this interest. Let me plan searches on open_web with relevance mode.\n\nSearch queries could be:\n1. \"TypeScript type system evolution\" \n2. \"TypeScript compiler roadmap\"\n3. \"TypeScript 5.x type system improvements\"\n4. \"TypeScript type inference improvements\"\n5. \"TypeScript compiler internals\"\n\nLet me start with a few searches. Since searches are independent, I can batch them.\n\nLet me do multiple searches in parallel targeting the interest.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"sourceId\":\"open_web\",\"query\":\"TypeScript type system evolution new features\",\"mode\":\"relevance\",\"limit\":20,\"targetInterestIds\":[\"evaluation:interest:typescript\"]}","name":"search_content"},"id":"call_00_ZayIZLfkiiDABfxGf5Bw6360","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"sourceId\":\"open_web\",\"query\":\"TypeScript compiler roadmap 2026\",\"mode\":\"relevance\",\"limit\":20,\"targetInterestIds\":[\"evaluation:interest:typescript\"]}","name":"search_content"},"id":"call_01_P8jKwSPNUB8KpU3lxmtd8102","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"sourceId\":\"open_web\",\"query\":\"TypeScript type system improvements type inference\",\"mode\":\"relevance\",\"limit\":20,\"targetInterestIds\":[\"evaluation:interest:typescript\"]}","name":"search_content"},"id":"call_02_gA8Cjo7ZJV05Ahjk6eS94945","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"query\": {\n    \"queryId\": \"candidate